sequenceDiagram
  participant C as OrderController
  participant P as Proxy (generated by Spring)
  participant A as Advice (transaction, timing, security…)
  participant T as Real OrderService
  C->>P: placeOrder(req)
  P->>A: before: begin transaction, start timer, check @PreAuthorize
  A->>T: proceed() → placeOrder(req)
  T->>T: this.reserveStock()  ← internal call: no proxy, no advice
  T-->>A: return order (or throw)
  A->>A: after: commit / rollback, record time
  A-->>P: result
  P-->>C: order
